{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24430","headline":"题谢公东山障子 · 白居易","name":"题谢公东山障子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤愚共在浮生内，贵贱同趋羣动间。\n多见忙时已衰病，少闻健日肯休闲。\n鹰饥受緤从难退，鹤老乘轩亦不还。\n唯有风流谢安石，拂衣携妓入东山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}